{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1 else if ndim(v_2) > ndim(v_1) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) = shape(v_1, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1
>>
Rule 39 (If either tensor is a scalar, their operation must be scalar logical and, other wise tensors' dimensions must be aligned )
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)) ∨ (if ndim(v_1) > ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1 else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) = shape(v_1, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 40 (When the shapes are not same, shapes of each corresponding dimensions in both tensor must either be equal or one of them must be 1, to ensure broadcastability)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1) ∨ (if ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1) else if ndim(v_2) < ndim(v_1) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : (shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1))
>>
Rule 41 (If shapes are not fully compatible, they still can be broadcasted to each other)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2)) then ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1)-1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2)-ndim(v_1)+i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 else if (ndim(v_2) < ndim(v_1)) then ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2)-1] : shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1)-ndim(v_2)+i) ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1 else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1)-1] : shape(v_1,i) = shape(v_2,i) ∨ shape(v_1,i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2,i) = 1
>>
Rule 42 (Shapes are compatible or at least broadcastable, and if dtypes are not bool, make sure to cast.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ((ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i))) ∨ (if ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1) else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : (shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1))) ∧ (dtype_(v_1) = "bool" ∨ dtype_(v_2) = "bool")
